    "context": "SCHED_EXT priority metadata queries on native musl ELF64: 450 root/UID1000 checks per architecture, 448 raw/libc bounds queries over 16 policies and six raw word forms plus two final policy/priority controls. Original 28 policy 7 failures, corrected/reference zero; identical probe ELF/C on original/corrected/Linux 6.12.51. Two warmed 200-cycle cohorts keep all slabs/large pages flat. Four fresh production builds, two pure query C changes and one scalar macro, five-case native profiles, eight host test files, unchanged allocation allowance failures, compiler/source/ELF pins and independent lifetime review. First standalone-helper compile failure is retained separately. No class/BPF installation, scheduler mutation, permissions, target races, glibc, translated/ELF32 or broad roadmap completion is claimed.",
